sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Your app
    participant GW as API gateway
    participant Auth
    participant REST as PostgREST
    participant DB as Postgres

    App->>GW: /auth/v1/... (API key)
    GW->>Auth: checks the key, strips the prefix
    Auth->>DB: as supabase_auth_admin
    Auth-->>App: JWT
    App->>GW: /rest/v1/... (API key, JWT)
    GW->>REST: checks the key, strips the prefix
    REST->>DB: as authenticator
    REST-->>App: JSON
